# Build-time settings (Vite reads VITE_* from .env files and the environment). Everything here has a default; a build sets one only to change it.

# The sermon index service the Sermons sheet asks for the newest rows and its search (src/config.ts SERMONS_URL, docs/sermons.md 'When online').
# Free to read: no licence, no key. Empty means none, and the sheet shows the bundled index alone.
VITE_SERMONS_URL=https://sermons.allmymind.org
